<h2 id="admonitions" class="anchor-heading group relative w-fit scroll-mt-20 leading-tight font-medium lg:scroll-mt-5 tracking-tighter"><span>Admonitions</span><a class="rounded-full px-2 no-underline opacity-0 transition-opacity duration-200 group-hover:opacity-100 hover:border-none hover:opacity-100 focus-visible:opacity-100 focus-visible:outline-offset-0 sm:hidden" href="#admonitions" aria-label="Link to Admonitions"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="14" height="14" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 14 14" class="inline text-green-44 dark:text-green-52 w-3.5"><path stroke="currentColor" stroke-linecap="square" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="1.4" d="m3.938 12.688 1.75-11.375M8.313 12.688l1.75-11.375M3.063 4.813h8.75M2.188 9.188h8.75"></path></svg></a></h2>
<p>The Neon documentation supports the following admonitions:</p>
<ul>
<li>Note</li>
<li>Important</li>
<li>Tip</li>
<li>Warning</li>
<li>Info</li>
</ul>
<p>To use an admonition, enclose your text with <code>&lt;Admonition&gt;&lt;/Admonition&gt;</code> and specify the admonition type: <code>note</code>, <code>important</code>, <code>tip</code>, <code>warning</code>, and <code>info</code>. The default is <code>note</code>.</p>
<p>For a complete list of available components and their usage, see the <a class="" href="/docs/community/component-guide">Component Guide</a>.</p>
